Package: vastR
Type: Package
Title: Drive the Vast Large-File Viewer from RStudio
Version: 0.6.34
Authors@R: person("Vast", email = "vast@local", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Open large files in the Vast macOS viewer from R with tidyverse-
    compatible dplyr verbs (filter, select, arrange), pipe workflows, and row slices
    without loading the whole file into memory.
License: MIT
Depends: R (>= 4.0)
Imports: dplyr, jsonlite, rlang, tidyselect, utils, vroom
SystemRequirements: Vast.app (macOS), curl
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
URL: https://github.com/yikeshu0611/vastR
BugReports: https://github.com/yikeshu0611/vastR/issues
